"- **Email:** {{COMPANY_EMAIL}}\n"
"- **Registry / registration number:** {{COMPANY_REGISTRY}}\n"
"- **Information Officer:** {{DPO_NAME}} — {{DPO_EMAIL}}"
msgstr ""
"## Chi siamo\n"
"\n"
